## Dataset Classes

### `ThinSliceDataset` (training — `06_train_from_scratch.ipynb`)
- Reads pre-cached `.npy` slices from `CACHE_DIR` (built once by `build_disk_cache`)
- `__getitem__` returns a single `(1, 256, 256)` tensor
- DataLoader: `batch_size=8`, `num_workers=4`, `drop_last=True`

### `BraTSDataset` (inference — `07_inference_healthy_reconstruction.ipynb`)
- Lazy flat index: one item per valid axial slice across all cases
- `__getitem__` returns `{image, seg, case, z_idx, has_tumor}`
- Custom `brats_collate_fn` handles mixed-type batches
- `tumor_only=True` filters to slices with any non-zero seg label

