## Checkpoints

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `./diffusion_epoch0030.pt` | 30-epoch baseline (old arch: out_ch=1, channels=(64,128,256,256)) |
| `./logs/checkpoints/diffusion_best.pt` | Best val-MSE checkpoint (new arch, updated by nb06) |
| `./logs/checkpoints/diffusion_epochXXXX.pt` | Periodic checkpoints every `SAVE_EVERY` epochs |

**⚠ Architecture mismatch:** `diffusion_epoch0030.pt` uses the OLD architecture
(`out_channels=1`, `channels=(64,128,256,256)`). New training runs produce checkpoints
with `out_channels=2`, `channels=(128,256,256,512)`. The comment in nb07 Cell 13
explains how to load either.

