## Inference Functions

| Function | Signature | Purpose |
|----------|-----------|---------|
| `ddim_encode` | `(x0, mask, scheduler, encode_timestep=500)` | Forward-noise x₀ → x_L inside mask |
| `hybrid_decode` | `(x_L, x0_orig, mask, unet, ddpm, ddim, start_t, n_steps)` | Returns `(x_hat, uncertainty)` |
| `anomaly_map` | `(x0, x_hat, smooth_sigma=2.0)` | `\|x₀ − x̂₀\|` with Gaussian smoothing |
| `denoise_from_noised_sample` | `(x0, encode_t, n_steps=50)` | Full-image noise → denoise, no mask |
| `generate_from_noise` | `(n_samples, n_steps, seed)` | Unconditional DDIM generation from N(0,I) |

`hybrid_decode` now returns a tuple — callers must unpack: `x_hat, uncert = hybrid_decode(...)`

